. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZvnbKVjV6gQ7kNvwFXUjPR&_nc_oc=Adrf_VnFWn7PcmCOcPjpqaIzrg_gR5B6kRjyfqko6p6w-45FHX895yUVO1xE5FMJoRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1IvuDshKO1oe6NSZDmvBPCB0UL8I-ceJLqyXIGrbCFyw&oe=69F352BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fhu_DMdbonwQ7kNvwGhRMZ-&_nc_oc=Adpvz0U4pqlD7xc1npFLX9gH05UCTfOgt7SVHe0vKVDtlJjLnu4bQd30ueW97RB_XIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3AMDEy7txGBXW0-ZmWOlI-OOVFs2C7p7_vbpF8js66pQ&oe=69F3695E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dUkBwmaYpxIQ7kNvwFao3A_&_nc_oc=AdoPQt3Tn_Y-33ZYDB1Mn8YQIRoGC6BUWpOvY1MDrm3ZvIa4kAvxZCUg9cepoVDobvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2UmwbcHylGssEPAQqVB70EtUvhvrgyGCUdTkklPeB7_w&oe=69F35EDB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco